'''Skyline''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that is currently obtainable in the [[Summer Event 2025|2025 Summer Event]] by purchasing the [[2025 Summer Box]] for 800  [[Beach Balls]] {{Currency|Beach Ball}} or through trading.

== Appearance ==
The knife uses the same mesh as the [[Default Knife]]. The blade portrays a city skyline in a cloudy night, hence the name.

